flowchart TB
    CSV[Read-only work orders CSV] --> C[AsyncCoordinator]
    C -->|start each order concurrently| G

    subgraph G[Compiled scheduling graph]
        S((START)) --> T[negotiation_transition]
        T --> E((END))
    end

    E -->|retained per-order state and outbound message| C
    CLI[Single CLI stdin receiver] -->|full inbound message body| Q[Per-work-order FIFO queue]
    Q -->|resume state with inbound_message| C
    C -->|one graph invocation per event| G

    T -. state cursor .-> W[NegotiationWorkflow]
    W -.-> D[Language, availability, agenda, consent, reversal, handoff transitions]
    D -. update .-> T
    T -->|scheduled confirmations complete| F[Two-line scheduled terminal frame]
    T -->|review closure complete| R[Two-line requires_review terminal frame]
    F --> C
    R --> C

    A[Shared InMemoryScheduleAuthority] <--> W
    C -->|displaced hold event| Q
